Complete local Java example; the app itself does not execute it:
```java
sealed interface Outcome permits Success, Failure {}
final class Success implements Outcome {}
final class Failure implements Outcome {}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Outcome outcome = new Success();
        System.out.println(outcome != null);
    }
}

```

